    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/f60f2ce5-d328-4b9b-8d93-058ee1203ab1.jpeg",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "保时捷在中国下降背后的原因是多重压力交织，主要包括：",
      "path": "assets/figure_003.jpg",
      "sha256": "644eb7b71dc5100ee8b45ed6313c156b34f638d6bc6f83d5d343a852bc6d4f3d",
      "bytes": 116273,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 1820,
      "content_type": "image/jpeg",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/f60f2ce5-d328-4b9b-8d93-058ee1203ab1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/2a7c65c6-2d1b-4e3a-a703-3ccc2d693a38.jpeg",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "这都2025年了，这个电池平台还是中国2021-2022年的设计想法，这确实是开发周期过长带来的问题。",
      "path": "assets/figure_004.jpg",
      "sha256": "7cc38254e94aebcf63c2b69e6c6f86cb39146683075e01d194c8889294dc99cf",
      "bytes": 80493,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 561,
      "content_type": "image/jpeg",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/2a7c65c6-2d1b-4e3a-a703-3ccc2d693a38.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/5474798c-2d15-4b53-84bb-e0008f04e7f0.jpeg",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "客观来说，保时捷在动力方面的优势，竟然被中国车企反超甚至是完爆了，这有点尴尬了。",
      "path": "assets/figure_005.jpg",
      "sha256": "e315eee27f2174fc3e15e995652fd84425b8955cf9421df4e9e074a638470e58",
      "bytes": 73069,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 561,
      "content_type": "image/jpeg",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/5474798c-2d15-4b53-84bb-e0008f04e7f0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/a3384ae2-2825-43ba-a29e-487c3aa149a7.jpeg",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "我们后续会对保时捷的平台做详细的叙述对比，分析下为什么保时捷做这么早，投入这么多钱，从参数方面反而持续落下风了。",
      "path": "assets/figure_006.jpg",
      "sha256": "6f411b52b655fb30089dba8ca6efabddb7a7c02b60739494153b86b14c2b7257",
      "bytes": 49296,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 578,
      "content_type": "image/jpeg",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/a3384ae2-2825-43ba-a29e-487c3aa149a7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/0687eb4d-ee78-4fb5-b5ab-2aa1a8c47e64.jpeg",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "经销商体系同样承受着压力。频繁出现的压库现象迫使部分经销商通过降价促销来清理库存，虽然短期内提升了销量，但长期来看损害了品牌形象和客户忠诚度。",
      "path": "assets/figure_007.jpg",
      "sha256": "d8f35691f29d6be061aa6cfec02fbf87b37f2925ea2b73c8c74022403dd4afcf",
      "bytes": 88291,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 521,
      "content_type": "image/jpeg",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/0687eb4d-ee78-4fb5-b5ab-2aa1a8c47e64.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/9da83f2f-eaff-4348-b1b6-b387985acbca.jpeg",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "当然我们客观来说，保时捷也在开拓战略市场，其实没有中国市场对于保时捷来说也没关系，也就是5万台车嘛！",
      "path": "assets/figure_008.jpg",
      "sha256": "62439652736a74984e054fadd284b162ebd5abe1c48365eca3709aeee9c25534",
      "bytes": 78456,
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 563,
      "content_type": "image/jpeg",
      "final_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/9da83f2f-eaff-4348-b1b6-b387985acbca.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "source_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/88616ab2-8d72-415a-8df6-fdadaa712351.jpeg",
      "status": "complete",
      "alt": "",
      "context_before": "",
      "context_after": "中国市场的高增长时代已经结束，对于保时捷而言，这不仅是一场短期危机，更是一次战略调整的契机。",
      "path": "assets/figure_009.jpg",
